_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 4
---
order: 4
---
short_label: VII.4
---
statement: Any number is either a part or parts of any number, the less of the greater.
---
proof:

Let *A* and *BC* be two numbers, and let *BC* be the less.

I say that *BC* is either a part, or parts, of *A.*

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="120" height="220" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="VII.4 diagram" src="propVII4.gif"/></noscript>
